# API Testing

API testing was performed for relevant Kredily HRMS API endpoints identified from the Android application bundle.

## APIs Identified

1. Credentials Verification
2. Leave Balances
3. Attendance Clock In
4. Attendance Clock Out
5. Leave Requests

Positive and negative test scenarios are documented in the API Testing Excel report.

A Postman collection containing the identified API requests and positive/negative test templates is also included.

## Execution Note

The production API base URL and authentication/request details were not reliably exposed from the packaged APK. Therefore, no API response, status code, or execution result was fabricated.
